"This drive's controller rejected the self-test command — it advertises the capability but doesn't actually implement it (a known quirk of some budget NVMe SSDs). Nothing NVMeter can do; this is firmware-side. Live SMART monitoring still works normally." = "This drive's controller rejected the self-test command — it advertises the capability but doesn't actually implement it (a known quirk of some budget NVMe SSDs). Nothing NVMeter can do; this is firmware-side. Live SMART monitoring still works normally.";

